1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,194
A heart attack isn't always sudden and dramatic.

2
00:00:03,194 --> 00:00:05,647
Many start slowly, with mild discomfort.

3
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:10,382
It happens when a blocked artery cuts off blood to part of the heart muscle.

4
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:16,223
1 — Chest pressure, squeezing or pain that lasts minutes, or comes and goes.

5
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:21,315
2 — Pain or discomfort spreading to the arm, jaw, neck, back or stomach.

6
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:25,189
3 — Shortness of breath, with or without chest discomfort.

7
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:28,287
4 — Breaking out in a cold sweat.

8
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:33,583
5 — Nausea, vomiting, or feeling lightheaded.

9
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:40,245
Women get chest pain too, but more often breathlessness, nausea, or back or jaw pain.

10
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:44,174
Call emergency services right away, even if unsure.

11
00:00:44,174 --> 00:00:45,505
Don't drive yourself.
